  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - No loading or unloading of goods, including fuel, by vehicles arriving at or departing from the premises shall be carried out otherwise than within the curtilage of the building.\r\n\r\nReason: To avoid obstruction of the surrounding streets and to safeguard amenities of adjacent premises in accordance with the requirements of policy TR23 of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development Plan 2000.  \r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The areas shown on the approved drawings and report as\r\n    access, loading and manoeuvring areas shall be provided and\r\n    retained permanently and shall not be used other than for\r\n    the purposes shown.",
    "Condition : 3 - Following implementation of phase 2 of the development, no\r\n    cars shall thereafter be parked on any section of the east\r\n    side of Torrington Square outside the SOAS buildings. Road\r\n    markings shall indicate this restriction, as required.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the implementation of phase 2 of the development, a\r\n    delivery schedule indicating a management programme for the\r\n    maximum expected accumulation and size of service and\r\n    delivery vehicles shall be submitted to the Council for\r\n    approval and thereafter the approved schedule shall be fully\r\n    complied with.",
    "Condition : 5 - Details of the design of building foundations and the\r\n    layout, with dimensions and levels, of service trenches and\r\n    other excavations on site in so far as these items may\r\n    affect the trees on Torrington Square, shall be submitted to\r\n    and approved by the Council as the local planning authority\r\n    before any works on phase 2 of the development are\r\n    commenced.  The development shall be carried out in\r\n    accordance with the details thereby agreed.",
    "Condition : 6 - A landscaping scheme for each phase of the development as\r\n    defined by PL-002/LANDSCAPE/C shall be submitted to and\r\n    approved by the Council prior to the occupation of the\r\n    relevant phase of the development hereby approved.  The\r\n    approved design shall be fully implemented by the end of the\r\n    planting season following occupation and thereafter be\r\n    maintained.",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the use commences, details of the method of storage and waste removal (including recycled materials) shall be submitted to and approved by the Council and the approved method shall thereafter be maintained.\r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the amenities of the [adjoining] premises [and the area generally] in accordance with the requirements of policy[ies] RE2[, EN5, EN6, DS6 (and SH18 if A3 use)] of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development Plan 2000.\r\n",
    "Condition : 8 - Full details of the proposed new and reconstructed roof\r\n    any approval given.\r\n    plant enclosures on the roof of the Holden Building,\r\n    (including details of sound attenuation for the necessary\r\n    plant, details of proposed equipment for ventilation and the\r\n    extraction of fumes from the Holden Building and the exact\r\n    size, position, and materials of the plant enclosure) shall\r\n    be submitted to the Council as a separate planning\r\n    application and approved by the Council and the development\r\n    shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with",
    "Condition : 9 - To avoid obstruction of the roads surrounding the Square and\r\n    to safeguard pedestrians and the amenities of adjacent\r\n    premises.",
    "Condition : 10 - The areas shown on the approved drawings and report as\r\n    access, loading and manoeuvring areas shall be provided and\r\n    retained permanently and shall not be used other than for\r\n    the purposes shown.",
    "Condition : 11 - To avoid obstruction of the roads surrounding the Square and\r\n    to safeguard pedestrians and the amenities of adjacent\r\n    premises.",
    "Condition : 12 - To avoid an accumulation of delivery vehicles by ensuring\r\n    that the proposed delivery bay receives deliveries in a well\r\n    managed programmed way throughout the day.",
    "Condition : 13 - To ensure that the Council may be satisfied that the\r\n    development will not have an adverse effect on existing\r\n    trees and in order to maintain the character and amenities\r\n    of the area.",
    "Condition : 14 - To ensure that the landscaping is carried out within a\r\n    reasonable period and to achieve a satisfactory standard of\r\n    visual amenity in the scheme.",
    "Condition : 15 - To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and the\r\n    area generally.",
    "Condition : 16 - To safeguard the amenities of the adjoining premises and the\r\n    area generally.",
    "Condition : 17 - The details required pursuant to additional conditions 4, 5,\r\n    6, 7 & 8 should be submitted with the attached approval of\r\n    details application form together with 5 sets of drawings\r\n    and any other supporting information.",
    "Condition : 18 - Your attention is drawn to the fact that there is a separate\r\n    legal agreement with the Council which relates to the\r\n    development for which this permission is granted."
  ],
